<BaseLayout title="Terms — Zero Company Field Guide" description="Use, attribution, and independence terms for Zero Company Field Guide." path="/terms/" noindex={true}>
  <article class="shell legal">
    <p class="eyebrow">INDEPENDENT FAN GUIDE</p>
    <h1>Terms and independence</h1>
    <p>This website is not endorsed by or affiliated with EA or its licensors. It is an independent fan guide and is not operated by Electronic Arts, Lucasfilm Games, Bit Reactor, or Respawn Entertainment.</p>
    <h2>Evidence boundary</h2>
    <p>Game facts are scoped to the sources and verification dates shown on each page. Search-demand records guide page planning but do not establish game mechanics.</p>
    <h2>Media and marks</h2>
    <p>STAR WARS, game imagery, and related names belong to their respective owners. Official material is presented for an independent, source-linked fan guide with visible attribution and removal on a substantiated rights-holder request.</p>
    <h2>Content policy</h2>
    <p>The site is operated with reference to <a href="https://help.ea.com/en/articles/security-and-rules/ea-content-policy/" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank">EA's content policy</a>. No game files, datamined assets, cheats, or paywalled game content are distributed here.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
<style>.legal{max-width:780px;padding:4rem 0}.legal h1{font-size:clamp(2.7rem,7vw,5rem)}.legal h2{margin-top:2.2rem}.legal p{color:var(--muted-strong)}</style>
